        "Content": "Tipper, Newtowncashel, Co.Longford.\r\nA quiet rural area close to the award winning village of Newtowncashel.\r\nNew to market is this three bedroom bungalow style residence.\r\nAccommodation Includes  :  \r\nEntrance Hall  :  1.2 x 1.7. Carpet.\r\nSitting room  :  3.8 x 4.5 Open fireplace, carpet.\r\nLiving room  :  4.5 x 4.2 Laminate flooring, open fireplace.\r\nKitchen / Dining  :  4.6 x 3.0.  Solid fuel cooker, fitted units.\r\nBack hall  :  7.6 x 0.9.\r\nBedroom 1.  :  3.56 x 2.8 Carpet, fireplace.\r\nBedroom 2.  :  3.5 x 2.8  Carpet, Fireplace.\r\nBedroom 3.  :  4.6 x 3.6 Laminate flooring..\r\nBathroom  :  2.9 x 2.0.  Level deck shower, basin, cistern.\r\n\r\nServices  :  Mains water, Oil fired heating, sewage treatment by septic tank.\r\n\r\nOutside  :  Lawn area to front and side, Yard and large work/shop / store to rear.\r\n\r\nWith some minor improvements this property will make a cozy family home in a quiet and peaceful rural area. To arrange your viewing contact John, 043 3341176 or 086 8346559 at any time."
